<!--
  Z01_std_add_head (量产加头版) — mjlab-ready MuJoCo model.

  Derived from ../xml/Z01_std_add_head.xml (URDF -> MJCF converter output).
  Differences vs. the generated source model:
    1. World-level lights / ground plane / skybox+checker textures and materials
       removed (the mjlab scene supplies terrain and lighting).
    2. The <actuator> block removed; mjlab builds <position> actuators from
       z01_std_add_head_constants.py (effort/velocity limits taken from the
       joint CSV, armature from the same source).
    3. URDF-transcribed collision proxies (boxes / cylinders) are named
       "<link>_collision" so mjlab's CollisionCfg, which matches geoms by name
       and disables all non-matching geoms, keeps them.
    4. Sensors renamed/added to mjlab conventions: imu_ang_vel, imu_lin_vel,
       imu_lin_acc, root_angmom (noise is injected by the task obs terms).
    5. Contact exclusions added for torso_link <-> {left,right}_hip_roll_link,
       whose collision proxies interpenetrate in the nominal pose.

  Joint names are kept exactly as in the source model (no "_joint" suffix).
  Meshes stay in ../meshes/ (shared with the generated model).
-->
